GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Sample_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Sample_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929> a narr:Digest ;
